slftp REST API Documentation (Beta)
Status: Early beta; Windows untested.

Base URL
- http://<host>:<port>/api (default http://127.0.0.1:8089/api)
- Calls are POST to /api/<Interface>/<Method> with JSON bodies; responses often wrap data in result: [ ... ].

Authentication
- If apikey is set in config/slftp.ini, send Authorization: Bearer <key>.
- If apikey is empty, no auth required (not recommended on exposed hosts).
- API key protection only applies to /api/* paths; web UI is served without auth.

Implemented Endpoints

System (ApiSystemService)
- GetStatus: Returns Version, Uptime, SitesCount/Up/Down, QueueSize, ActiveTasks.
- GetUptime: Returns uptime in seconds.
- GetVersion: Returns version string.
- Shutdown: Initiates graceful shutdown.
- CreateBackup: Creates configuration backup.
- GetRecentReleases: Body {"Limit": 20}. Returns recent releases with site counts (TotalSites, AllowedSites, PresentSites, ExpectedSites, NotAllowedSites).
- GetReleaseDetails: Body {"PazoId": <id>}. Returns release details.
- GetAutoStatus: Body {}. Returns global auto status.
- SetAutoStatus: Body {"Enabled":true|false}. Sets global auto status.

Sites (ApiSitesService)
- GetSites: Body {"Filter":""}. Returns list of sites.
- GetSite: Body {"SiteName":"<name>"}. Returns basic site details.
- GetSiteCredits: Body {"SiteName":"<name>", "ForceRefresh":true|false}. Returns credits/ratio data.
- GetSiteInfo: Body {"SiteName":"<name>"}. Returns full site details including BNCs, automation settings, country, etc.
- AddSite: Body {"Name":"...", "Host":"...", "Port":21, "Username":"...", "Password":"...", "SslEnabled":true|false}
- DeleteSite: Body {"SiteName":"<name>"}
- SetSiteStatus: Body {"SiteName":"<name>","Status":"UP|DOWN"}
- SetSiteSlots: Body {"SiteName":"<name>","Slots":<int>}
- SetSiteMaxUpDn: Body {"SiteName":"<name>","MaxUp":<int>,"MaxDn":<int>}
- SetSiteMaxPreDn: Body {"SiteName":"<name>","MaxPreDn":<int>}
- SetSitePermDown: Body {"SiteName":"<name>","PermDown":true|false}
- SetSiteAutoLogin: Body {"SiteName":"<name>","Enabled":true|false}
- SetSiteAutoRules: Body {"SiteName":"<name>","IntervalSeconds":<int>}
- SetSiteAffils: Body {"SiteName":"<name>","Affils":"GRP1 GRP2"}
- SetSiteIrcNick: Body {"SiteName":"<name>","IrcNick":"..."}
- SetSiteCredentials: Sets detailed credentials/BNCs.
- SetSiteConfig: Body {"SiteName":"<name>", "Config":{...}}. Sets misc options (autobnctest, country, etc).
- RunSiteAutoRules: Body {"SiteName":"<name>"}
- GetSiteRoutes: Body {"SiteName":"<name>"}
- SetSiteRoute: Body {"SourceSite":"...", "DestSite":"...", "Speed":<int>, "Locked":bool, "AffilOnly":bool, "NoAffil":bool}
- TestSite: Body {"SiteName":"<name>"}
- ResolveHostname: Body {"Hostname":"..."}
- GhostSite: Body {"SiteName":"<name>"}
- RecalcFreeSlots: Body {"SiteName":"<name>"}
- RebuildSlots: Body {"SiteName":"<name>"}
- ExecuteIrcCommand: Body {"Command":"..."}
- GetAvailableSections: Returns list of known sections.
- GetSiteSections: Body {"SiteName":"<name>"}
- SetSiteSection: Body {"SiteName":"...", "Section":"...", "Dir":"..."}
- GetSiteRtpl: Body {"SiteName":"<name>"}. Returns raw RTPL file content.
- GetSiteRulesSnapshot: Body {"SiteName":"<name>"}. Returns the cached SITE RULES snapshot.
- SaveSiteRtpl: Body {"SiteName":"...", "Content":"...", "ExpectedMd5":"...", "Reload":bool}
- ValidateRtpl: Body {"Content":"..."}
- ReloadRules: Reloads all rules.
- GetRuleConditions: Returns available rule conditions.

