Config (ApiConfigService)
- GetConfigList: Body {}. Returns list of editable config files.
- GetConfigContent: Body {"Filename":"..."}. Returns content of the specified file.
- SaveConfigContent: Body {"Filename":"...", "Content":"..."}. Saves content to the file.
- ReloadConfig: Body {"Filename":"..."}. Reloads the configuration file if supported. Supported files: slftp.precatcher, slftp.skip, slftp.skipgroups, slftp.rules, slftp.languagebase, slftp.knowngroups, slftp.imdbcountries, slftp.imdbreplace, slftp.spamconf. Returns true on success.